    "name": "Dreamers Disease",
    "steam_appid": 2870400,
    "required_age": 0,
    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2870400/extras/fa32d695c1de31b856ee598c38a8b5cd.poster.avif?t=1740839294\" width=426 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2870400/extras/fa32d695c1de31b856ee598c38a8b5cd.webm?t=1740839294\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2870400/extras/fa32d695c1de31b856ee598c38a8b5cd.mp4?t=1740839294\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>Dreamers Disease is a fast-paced atmospheric boomer shooter where you go deeper into your dreams to kill the illness dubbed &quot;Dreamers Disease&quot;. Thanks to new technology you are able to Shoot Yourself in the head, and the bullets fly back at higher speeds! But you will have to be really careful with your health while doing this. <br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2870400/extras/27710b535e492158054e716bb92235dd.poster.avif?t=1740839294\" width=426 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2870400/extras/27710b535e492158054e716bb92235dd.webm?t=1740839294\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2870400/extras/27710b535e492158054e716bb92235dd.mp4?t=1740839294\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>The game is inspired by FPS games such as Dusk and ULTRAKILL. Dreamers Disease is Fast and Chaotic, you will get overwhelmed by the variety of enemies and you will die, but if you focus and prioritize enemies you just might make it out alive.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2870400/extras/7e493e992a7e5b27ab7f8eafea360cd1.poster.avif?t=1740839294\" width=426 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2870400/extras/7e493e992a7e5b27ab7f8eafea360cd1.webm?t=1740839294\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2870400/extras/7e493e992a7e5b27ab7f8eafea360cd1.mp4?t=1740839294\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>Explore impossible spaces and nonsensical architecture that your dreams create, you never know where the Dreamers Disease will be.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2870400/extras/efea3ce2a99c2a960cc999c296fe8be3.poster.avif?t=1740839294\" width=426 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2870400/extras/efea3ce2a99c2a960cc999c296fe8be3.webm?t=1740839294\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2870400/extras/efea3ce2a99c2a960cc999c296fe8be3.mp4?t=1740839294\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>Dreamers Disease has a big focus on worldbuilding and story. You will have to look for clues as to what is happening and to figure out that most of what you think, isn't what it seems.",
    "about_the_game": "<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2870400/extras/fa32d695c1de31b856ee598c38a8b5cd.poster.avif?t=1740839294\" width=426 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2870400/extras/fa32d695c1de31b856ee598c38a8b5cd.webm?t=1740839294\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2870400/extras/fa32d695c1de31b856ee598c38a8b5cd.mp4?t=1740839294\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>Dreamers Disease is a fast-paced atmospheric boomer shooter where you go deeper into your dreams to kill the illness dubbed &quot;Dreamers Disease&quot;. Thanks to new technology you are able to Shoot Yourself in the head, and the bullets fly back at higher speeds! But you will have to be really careful with your health while doing this. <br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2870400/extras/27710b535e492158054e716bb92235dd.poster.avif?t=1740839294\" width=426 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2870400/extras/27710b535e492158054e716bb92235dd.webm?t=1740839294\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2870400/extras/27710b535e492158054e716bb92235dd.mp4?t=1740839294\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>The game is inspired by FPS games such as Dusk and ULTRAKILL. Dreamers Disease is Fast and Chaotic, you will get overwhelmed by the variety of enemies and you will die, but if you focus and prioritize enemies you just might make it out alive.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2870400/extras/7e493e992a7e5b27ab7f8eafea360cd1.poster.avif?t=1740839294\" width=426 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2870400/extras/7e493e992a7e5b27ab7f8eafea360cd1.webm?t=1740839294\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2870400/extras/7e493e992a7e5b27ab7f8eafea360cd1.mp4?t=1740839294\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>Explore impossible spaces and nonsensical architecture that your dreams create, you never know where the Dreamers Disease will be.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2870400/extras/efea3ce2a99c2a960cc999c296fe8be3.poster.avif?t=1740839294\" width=426 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2870400/extras/efea3ce2a99c2a960cc999c296fe8be3.webm?t=1740839294\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2870400/extras/efea3ce2a99c2a960cc999c296fe8be3.mp4?t=1740839294\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>Dreamers Disease has a big focus on worldbuilding and story. You will have to look for clues as to what is happening and to figure out that most of what you think, isn't what it seems.",
